US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">졸업유예자 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">▷&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">외국어시험성적 적용기준&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">2023. 12. 1. ~ 2024. 11. 30.</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">까지 취득한 성적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">응시일자 기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">외국어 성적 입력 및 성적표 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">업로드</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">2024. 12. 31.(</font><font style=\"\" face=\"함초롬바탕\">화</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">*</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기한엄수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">*</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기한 내 우리대학&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">‘BISKIT’</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 입력 및 제출되어야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공인외국어시험 및 국제교류교육원에서 실시하는 모의토익</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모의토익스피킹 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모두 인정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">국제교류교육원에서 실시하는 모의토익</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모의토익스피킹 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">성적은 국제교류교육원에서 일괄 등록하므로 학생이 별도로 입력 및 제출하지 않아도 됨&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;하지만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">본인의 성적이 우리대학&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">‘BISKIT’</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 제대로 입력되어 있는지&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">\"</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기한 내에</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">\" \"</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생본인이</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">\" “</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">반드시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">”&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">확인하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모의토익 성적이 제대로 반영되어 있지 않거나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모의토익 문의는 어학상담실&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">478-7959,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">국제교류교육원&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">478-7215</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">로 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 40pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교내 성적장학생은 외국어성적을 취득하여야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">외국어시험성적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">토익기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">을 제출하지 않을 경우 성적장학생 선발에서 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 40pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">외국어시험성적은 장학선발의 기본자격이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자격충족자 중 우수자 선발</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.1pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">등록학기 기준으로 학년이 적용(2학년 1학기에 장학생 선정되기 위해서는 1학년때의 외국어성적이 있어야함)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.1pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.1pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">ex) 1-2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">학기 성적으로&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">2-1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">학기 등록시 장학생으로 선정되기 위해서는&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">학년 외국어성적기준을 충족해야함</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">승인완료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">:</span>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">2025. 1. 10.(</font><font style=\"\" face=\"함초롬바탕\">금</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학과 연락처&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">붙임</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기한 내 우리대학&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">‘BISKIT’</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 승인완료 되어야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">미승인시 성적장학대상에서 제외 됨</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">▷&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제출 방법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">붙임&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">외국어성적 입력 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">’&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">참고&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공인외국어시험점수환산표수정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">붙임&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1. 2025-1&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교내 성적장학생 선발관련 외국어성적표 제출 안내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; f